# The build COPYs nothing from the context: Lane 1 tools arrive via `COPY --from` upstream
# stages, and the Lane 2 binary (container-structure-test) is fetched with `ADD <url>` in its
# build stage. So the context needs to carry nothing at all: ignore everything. Docker still
# reads the Dockerfile and this .dockerignore regardless. If a tool ever needs a local file
# COPYed in, allow it back with a `!path` negation below.
*
